{"type": "run", "run_id": "daily_exhausted-20261110T183141Z", "scenario": "daily_exhausted", "source": "stand-in", "duration_s": 300.0, "seed": 7, "arrivals": 14, "switches": {"p503": 0.0, "stall_rate": 0.0, "stall_s": 8.0, "slow_under_load": false, "load_alpha": 0.15, "limit_scale": 1.0, "limit_scale_only": ""}, "naive": false, "patience": {"median_s": 25.0, "sigma": 0.6}, "naive_retry": null, "exhaust_daily": true, "note": "rerun of all 7 scenarios: the first stand-in run (20261110T181851Z) never replayed refusals and its placeholder could be a paragraph label ('Metrics.'), which failed the citation gate; it also lacked qwen's OTPM limit. The first run's files stay in results/raw/runs.", "started": "2026-11-10T18:31:41.416+00:00"}
{"type": "answer", "run_id": "daily_exhausted-20261110T183141Z", "scenario": "daily_exhausted", "source": "stand-in", "setting": "large", "setting_def": {"piece_chars": 2400, "k": 3, "rerank": false, "router": true}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "qid": "Q8", "request_id": "daily_exhausted-20261110T183141Z-0000", "start_time": "2026-11-10T18:31:58.041+00:00", "arrival_offset_s": 16.62, "patience_s": 19.48, "gave_up": false, "waited_ms": 8.2, "degraded": true, "reply": {"request_id": "daily_exhausted-20261110T183141Z-0000", "question": "What are Moshi's main components and what does each do?", "kind": "passages", "level": 3, "text": "No written answer this time: here are the most relevant passages from the papers, quoted as they are. A written answer should be possible in about 601 s.\n[S1] 2410.00037v1 pp.6-7 §3.1: \"To jointly model the audio streams from Moshi and the user, as well as Moshi’s text tokens, we rely on a Depth Transformer compatible with streaming inference (Sections 3.4.1, 3.4.2). In this section, we further detail each of these components. We then describe the training datasets and the different training phases we used to train Moshi in Section 4. Finally, in Section 5, we report thorough evaluation results on Moshi’s abilities, both linguistic and acoustic, as well as ablation experiments on its main components, while Section 6 provides analyses on the safety of our system.\"\n[S2] 2507.07955v2 pp.4-5 §2.1.1: \"H-Net employs a hierarchical architecture comprising three primary components – encoder networks (E), main network (M), and decoder networks (D) – where each component is implemented with a stack of sequence mixing layers (e.g., Transformers or state space models). In its simplest form, a single-stage H-Net consists of one encoder network, one main network, and one decoder network. Crucially, the architecture’s key characteristic lies in the main network’s unique property: it can itself be instantiated as a complete H-Net, enabling recursive construction of multi-level hierarchies.\"", "sources": [{"sid": "S1", "cite": "2410.00037v1 pp.6-7 §3.1", "pid": "moshi:2400:0009", "paper": "moshi", "block_ids": ["moshi-p06-b005", "moshi-p07-b001", "moshi-p07-b002"]}, {"sid": "S2", "cite": "2507.07955v2 pp.4-5 §2.1.1", "pid": "dynamic_chunking:2400:0007", "paper": "dynamic_chunking", "block_ids": ["dynamic_chunking-p04-b013", "dynamic_chunking-p04-b014", "dynamic_chunking-p04-b015", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b001", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b002", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b003", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b004", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b005", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b006", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b007", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b008", "dynamic_chunking-p05-b009"]}], "notice": "passages only, no model call: no drafter available (openai/gpt-oss-120b: TPD would not have room before the deadline (0 queued in front); openai/gpt-oss-20b: TPD would not have room before the deadline (0 queued in front); qwen/qwen3.8-27b: TPD would not have room before the deadline (0 queued in front))", "eta_s": 601.3, "model_calls": [{"step": "understand", "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "understand", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-20b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}, {"step": "draft", "model": "openai/gpt-oss-120b", "status": 429, "outcome": "rate_limited", "prompt_tokens": 0, "completion_tokens": 0}], "spans": [{"name": "plan", "start_ms": 0.0, "end_ms": 0.5, "model": null, "outcome": "full", "detail": {"predicted_wait_s": {"full": {"openai/gpt-oss-120b": 0.0, "openai/gpt-oss-20b": 0.0, "qwen/qwen3.8-27b": 0.0}}, "drafter": "openai/gpt-oss-120b"}}, {"name": "understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 2.9, "model": null, "outcome": "heuristic (qwen/qwen3.8-27b: 429 rate_limited; openai/gpt-oss-20b: 429 rate_limited)", "detail": {}}, {"name": "wait:understand", "start_ms": 0.5, "end_ms": 0.6, "model": "qwen/qwen3.8-27